          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "Gel permeation chromatography (GPC) showed the chloroformsoluble regioregular polymers have number-average molecular weights $( M _ { \\mathrm { n } } )$ranging from 19 800 to 47 900 (relative to polystyrene calibration standards), corresponding to degrees of polymerization (x) of 39-74 bithiophene repeating units $( \\mathrm { i . e . , }$$7 8 - 1 4 8$thiophene units) (Table 1)."
        }
