            964.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "Thermal Transitions. Thermal transitions of regiorandom and regioregular alternating alkyl:semifluoroalkyl polymers were determined by differential scanning calorimetry (DSC) (Table 1). Representative thermograms for the series Rg(Th-5,4/p) are shown in Figure 7. A single endothermic peak on heating and a single exothermic peak on cooling were observed, which can be assigned to melting and crystallization temperatures, respectively. Thermal cycling up to $2 5 0 { - } 2 7 0 ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$led to no noticeable decomposition."
        }
      ],
      "confidence": {
        "score": 0.9
      }
